  "body_text": "基本信息\n庄园主/种植者：Antonio & Anabela Meneses (第四代）\n庄园名称：圣塔菲蕾莎庄园-新奥尔良 Santa Felisa-New Orleans\n海拔高度：1600 米 masl\n产区：危地马拉-阿卡特南果-奎尔科-甘泉镇 Guatemala-Actenango-Cuilco-Agua Dulce\n品种：非洲种瑰夏 African Gesha\n处理方式：厌氧酵母日晒 Anaerobic yeast natural\n庄园面积：11 公顷 has\n年均降水：1200 - 1500 毫米\n本批次采收时间：2021年3月\n本批次生豆到港时间：2021.7\n烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n风味：白色花朵，橙子，葡萄，蜂蜜甜\nWhite flower, Orange, Grape, Honeyed sweet\n【庄园获奖记录】\n2016年危地马拉COE卓越杯，第二名 （Los Jutes）\n2017年危地马拉COE卓越杯，第一名（El Paraxaj） & 第八名（Santa Felisa）\n2019年危地马拉COE卓越杯，第十一名（Chualax）\n2019年危地马拉COE卓越杯，第十一名（Chualax）\n2020年危地马拉COE卓越杯，第十三名（El Paraxaj）\n关于圣塔菲蕾莎庄园 Santa Felisa\n圣塔菲蕾莎庄园由Mr.Trinidad E. Cruz创立于1904年，位于危地马拉的阿卡特南果区域，与Antigua和Atilan接壤，周围有两座火山（Actenango和Fuego），也因此土壤受益火山的不定期喷发带来的火山灰矿物质；圣塔菲蕾莎除了主庄园Santa Felisa之外，旗下还有El Paraxaj，Los Jutes 和Chualax庄园。\n圣塔菲蕾莎庄园除了友善环境的栽种方式以外，也非常重视与支持当地社区的平衡发展，庄园绝不使用童工，庄园内还设有一所小学，对在庄园工作的伙伴还提供下一代到高中的教育补助，也参与例如提供儿童餐饮、教育、医疗的Las Nubes Daycares公益计画。\n2011开始，现任经营者安东尼(Antonio Meneses)，决定办理庄园优质微批次的独立竞标，如同\n巴拿马\n的翡翠庄园般，这也是目前咖啡界少数的庄园单一竞标出现。\n这个批次是刚结束的2021年庄园竞拍批次的SF-8批次，品种是非洲种瑰夏，用红酒酵母浸泡咖啡果48小时，然后再在晒床做自然晾晒。\n众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～",
  "body_html": "<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xib7LS5bJLb5Wl2oHOKqRjZ2zS4w5EAwglNtmRx3m9g7Iw9yOh60dOIIA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n<strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">\n   基本信息\n  </strong>\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  庄园主/种植者：Antonio &amp; Anabela Meneses (第四代）\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  庄园名称：圣塔菲蕾莎庄园-新奥尔良 Santa Felisa-New Orleans\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  海拔高度：1600 米 masl\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  产区：危地马拉-阿卡特南果-奎尔科-甘泉镇 Guatemala-Actenango-Cuilco-Agua Dulce\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  品种：非洲种瑰夏 African Gesha\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  处理方式：厌氧酵母日晒 Anaerobic yeast natural\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  庄园面积：11 公顷 has\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  年均降水：1200 - 1500 毫米\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  本批次采收时间：2021年3月\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  本批次生豆到港时间：2021.7\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n  <br style=\"max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; visibility: visible;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  风味：白色花朵，橙子，葡萄，蜂蜜甜\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  White flower, Orange, Grape, Honeyed sweet\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xibJjrCNLzW6rkx1N8NJ5Bict9YwsTAVtdJK6fbMibgym3iayK1WiciaUD14qQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\" style=\"width: 578px !important; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<br style=\"visibility: visible;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  【庄园获奖记录】\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  2016年危地马拉COE卓越杯，第二名 （Los Jutes）\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.75em; visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px; visibility: visible;\">\n  2017年危地马拉COE卓越杯，第一名（El Paraxaj） &amp; 第八名（Santa Felisa）\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  2019年危地马拉COE卓越杯，第十一名（Chualax）\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  2019年危地马拉COE卓越杯，第十一名（Chualax）\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  2020年危地马拉COE卓越杯，第十三名（El Paraxaj）\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xibY8syJGgcicELbMJlcTLxPsv0zpwplau15NhtLONIWTvj02BWnlLJLoA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 187px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n   关于圣塔菲蕾莎庄园 Santa Felisa\n  </strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  圣塔菲蕾莎庄园由Mr.Trinidad E. Cruz创立于1904年，位于危地马拉的阿卡特南果区域，与Antigua和Atilan接壤，周围有两座火山（Actenango和Fuego），也因此土壤受益火山的不定期喷发带来的火山灰矿物质；圣塔菲蕾莎除了主庄园Santa Felisa之外，旗下还有El Paraxaj，Los Jutes 和Chualax庄园。\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xibPu5icVzpryO6rnCT6mDicr4FLNO87jWooJT0C5aM3pkNJjj0zUk5mnag/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;zoom: 1;font-size: 14px;\">\n  圣塔菲蕾莎庄园除了友善环境的栽种方式以外，也非常重视与支持当地社区的平衡发展，庄园绝不使用童工，庄园内还设有一所小学，对在庄园工作的伙伴还提供下一代到高中的教育补助，也参与例如提供儿童餐饮、教育、医疗的Las Nubes Daycares公益计画。\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xibnj7aQRNRfckXjia1FRic9ABvSLEvkV5gHAVvHSNW4uCqh7uXIhfu6esg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4\" style=\"text-align: center; white-space: normal; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;zoom: 1;font-size: 14px;\">\n  2011开始，现任经营者安东尼(Antonio Meneses)，决定办理庄园优质微批次的独立竞标，如同\n  <a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%B7%B4%E6%8B%BF%E9%A9%AC%E5%\" style=\"outline: 0px;zoom: 1;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;zoom: 1;text-decoration: underline;\">\n    巴拿马\n   </span>\n</a>\n  的翡翠庄园般，这也是目前咖啡界少数的庄园单一竞标出现。\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xibHc9icPYpqFLu5OuEyUO2peeEaFXbEK7rqN5M6M8SLSJVKhHiaq5hyFuw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=5\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 680px !important;\"/>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TdCzdXa4ULuiaFVJqZibR0xib35icbF7wFPticov3lqc9TkaHUq3KVicIn7v3EegAQWM0P5wmUaSdTjbUQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=6\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 444px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  这个批次是刚结束的2021年庄园竞拍批次的SF-8批次，品种是非洲种瑰夏，用红酒酵母浸泡咖啡果48小时，然后再在晒床做自然晾晒。\n  <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  众号的文章板块有豆子信息\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n  淘宝店铺和有赞小程序可选购更多豆子～\n </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=7\" style=\"height: auto !important; width: 388px !important; visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>",
